{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"edits\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-1\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他一时只想沉在这份舒服里，难得不用反复琢磨两个人接下来会怎样。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他几乎想把一直藏着的话全说出来，也盼着对方能接受自己更坦白的样子，好让眼下的亲近留得久一点；可一想到对方会怎么想，心口又跳得厉害，怕说得太急反倒弄丢这份自在。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"op\": \"delete\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他舍不得抽身，便想：对方是不是也不愿先退开？\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他高兴得发晕，盼着以后对方需要时自己都能陪在身边。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他盼了那么久的亲近已经有了，想到这里，他高兴得心口发烫。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他已经没法像从前那样装作没那么在乎了。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"note\": \"共影响7条原条目。S03去掉同一念头的重复说明；S04合并想坦白、希望被接受和害怕破坏自在，保留愿望与顾虑，不再用两条反复解释同一犹豫；S06删去已经由S06-1交代过的对方仍然亲近这一依据，保留他由此产生的疑问；S07保留发现相互需要后的陪伴愿望，去掉与S02-3重复的提前舍不得当下；S11保留长久陪伴的意愿和获得亲近的喜悦，不再完整复述S07已经建立的相互需要；S13不再重复S09已经明确提出的对方可能不再需要他的恐惧，留下他已经无法假装不在乎这一新的处境，为想收回喜欢与最终不收回之间的转折留出空间。S09的具体恐惧、S11无法决定对方未来心意的顾虑、S12主动给予的愿望和S14眼下仍被需要的现实均保留。S14-3最终选择逐字不动。未处理S05主动显露与无意没藏住之间的表述风险，也未补写S06至S07互相需要的事实依据，因为本次只检验局部重复，且没有新增事实可供补充。S08至S14对未来的几次回返也没有一概删减，仍保留各自不同的作用。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fe7d59e8-6df9-488b-a6c6-e901cd8f5389", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261103T172348381033Z", "elapsed_seconds": 90.359, "completed_utc": "2026-11-03T17:25:18.795088+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b31db33788615d38933929c4e79b1bfae799c4c42179d9a2a8a47794daa0f941", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261103T172348381033Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "74c7fc47a13dc4256b58afc22a07f5a01d2294c2bc256614356db47aa960fc90"}}}
